 </span><span begin="02:52.290" end="02:52.530">in </span><span begin="02:52.530" end="02:53.250">disasters</span><span begin="02:53.250" end="02:56.280">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.280" end="03:00.030"><span begin="02:56.280" end="02:56.550">What </span><span begin="02:56.550" end="02:56.940">about </span><span begin="02:56.940" end="02:58.440">love</span><span begin="02:58.440" end="02:58.470">? </span><span begin="02:58.470" end="02:58.650">What </span><span begin="02:58.650" end="02:59.160">about </span><span begin="02:59.160" end="03:00.030">trust</span><span begin="03:00.030" end="03:00.030">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.030" end="03:05.070"><span begin="03:00.030" end="03:00.270">What </span><span begin="03:00.270" end="03:01.440">about </span><span begin="03:01.440" end="03:02.700">us</span><span begin="03:02.700" end="03:05.070">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.070" end="03:08.670"><span begin="03:05.070" end="03:05.760">Sticks </span><span begin="03:05.760" end="03:05.940">and </span><span begin="03:05.940" end="03:06.540">stones </span><span begin="03:06.540" end="03:06.810">they </span><span begin="03:06.810" end="03:07.260">may </span><span begin="03:07.260" end="03:07.770">break </span><span begin="03:07.770" end="03:08.220">these </span><span begin="03:08.220" end="03:08.670">bones</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.700" end="03:13.710"><span begin="03:08.700" end="03:08.940">But </span><span begin="03:08.940" end="03:09.780">then </span><span begin="03:09.780" end="03:10.050">I'll </span><span begin="03:10.050" end="03:10.260">be </span><span begin="03:10.260" end="03:11.820">ready</span><span begin="03:11.820" end="03:11.880">, </span><span begin="03:11.880" end="03:12.150">are </span><span begin="03:12.150" end="03:12.390">you </span><span begin="03:12.390" end="03:13.680">ready</span><span begin="03:13.680" end="03:13.710">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.710" end="03:18.150"><span begin="03:13